        "replacements": [
          [
            "Actual corrected browser and independent acceptance require a separate campaign.",
            "An independent Chrome campaign accepted26 native selections: nine literal and17 regex selections across LF, CRLF, bare CR and mixed endings, including eight astral endpoints. Two real delayed-response publication controls passed. The previous16 source/model cases were replayed unchanged except for imports and collector paths and are not new case groups. Native dirty-close Cancel remains incomplete because browser focus controls failed; a Save-specific browser campaign was not executed. The owned test host exited normally and removed its temporary data, while tab closure remains unconfirmed. These are finite checks; full host/workbench acceptance and comparative benchmarks remain open."
